{{Ability box
|name=Abduction
|image=Abduction.png
|category_type={{ct|Corruption}}
|category={{c|Torture}}
|require={{TalentReq/StrCorrsReq2}}
|cost=25 Stamina, 14 Vim
|cooldown=10
|range=5-10
|desc=
Hits the target doing {{cts|88|110}}% weapon damage. If the attack hits, you pull the target in and strike them again, dealing another {{cts|118|140}}% weapon damage.
}}

{{Ability_box
|image=absorption_strike.png
|name=Absorption strike
|category_type=[[Celestial (category type)|Celestial]]
|category={{c|Crusader}}
|require={{TalentReq/DiviReqHigh1}}
|use_mode=Activated
|cost=-7 Positive
|cooldown=8
|desc=
You strike your foe with your two handed weapon, dealing {{ctwd|110|230%}} weapon damage.

If the attack hits, all foes in radius 2 will have their light resistance reduced by {{cts|5|20%|0.75}} and their damage reduced by {{cts|1|15%|0.75}} (maximum 30%) for 5 turns.
}}

{{Ability_box
|name=Accelerate
|image=Accelerate.png
|category_type={{ct|Demented}}
|category={{c|Timethief}}
|game_version=1.7.4
|forbidden_version=1.0.12
|require={{TalentReq/DementedReq1}}
|cost=10 Insanity
|cooldown=12
|use_speed=0
|desc=
Distorting spacetime around yourself, you reduce the movement speed of all enemies in radius 4 by 50% for {{cts|2|4.5}} turns (rounded down).

You use the siphoned speed to grant yourself incredible quickness for 1 turn, increasing movement speed by {{cts|100|300}}%, increased by a further 1/8 for each enemy slowed, to a maximum of 4 enemies.

Any actions other than movement will cancel the effect.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Acid blood.png
|name=Acid Blood
|game_version=1.7.4
|category_type={{ct|Corruption}}
|category={{c|Reaving Combat}}
|require={{TalentReq/StrCorrsReq4}}
|use_mode=Passive
|desc=
Your blood turns into an acidic mixture. When you get hit, the attacker is splashed with acid.

This deals {{ctspd|5|30}} acid damage each turn for 5 turns, and reduces the attacker's Accuracy by {{ctspd|15|35}}.

At level 3, it will also reduce Armour by {{ctspd|15|40}} for 5 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Acid infusion.png
|name=Acid Infusion
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Acid Alchemy}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReq1}}
|use_mode=Sustained
|cost=30 Mana
|cooldown=30
|desc=
When you throw your alchemist bombs, you infuse them with explosive acid that can blind.

In addition all acid damage you do is increased by {{cts|5|25%}}.

Only one of {{t|Flame Infusion}}, {{t|Frost Infusion}} and {{t|Acid Infusion}} can be active.
}}

{{Ability box
|game_version=1.7.4
|image=Acidbeam.png
|name=Acidbeam
|category_type={{ct|Wild-Gift}}
|category={{c|Corrosive Blades}}
|require={{TalentReq/GiftsReqHigh1}}
|cost=4 Equilibrium
|cooldown=3
|range=10
|use_speed=Mind
|desc=
Channel acid through your psiblades, extending their reach to create a beam doing {{ctmd|20|290}} Acid damage (which can disarm them).

The damage increases with your Mindpower.

''Note: the disarm chance is 25% and uses your mindpower''
}}

{{Ability box
|game_version=1.7.4
|name=Acidfire
|image=Acidfire.png
|category_type={{ct|Wild-Gift}}
|category={{c|Eyal's Fury}}
|require={{TalentReq/GiftsReqHigh3}}
|range=8
|cost=20 Equilibrium
|cooldown=12
|use_speed=Mind
|desc=
You call upon the earth to create a blinding, corrosive cloud in an area of radius 4 for 5 turns.

Each turn, this cloud deals {{ctmd|10|120}} acid damage to each foe with a 25% chance to blind and a {{ctl|100%|25|40%}} chance of burning away one magical sustain or beneficial magical effect.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
}}

{{Ability box
|game_version=1.7.4
|image=Acidic soil.png
|name=Acidic Soil
|category_type={{ct|Wild-Gift}}
|category={{c|Corrosive Blades}}
|require={{TalentReq/GiftsReqHigh4}}
|use_mode=Sustained
|cost=15 Equilibrium
|cooldown=30
|use_speed=Mind
|desc=
Surround yourself with natural forces, ignoring {{ctl|100%|15|50%}} acid resistance of your targets.

In addition, the acid will nourish your bloated oozes, giving them an additional {{ctmd|10|75}} life regeneration per turn.
}}

{{Ability box
|game_version=1.4.5
|image=Acidic spray.png
|name=Acidic Spray
|category_type={{ct|Wild-Gift}}
|category={{c|Venom Drake Aspect}}
|require={{TalentReq/GiftsReq1}}
|cost=3 Equilibrium
|cooldown={{ctl|3|6.9|5.5}}
|range={{cts|5.5|7.5}}
|desc=
Spray forth a glob of acidic moisture at your enemy.

The target will take {{ctmd|25|250}} Mindpower-based acid damage.

Enemies struck have a 25% chance to be Disarmed for three turns, as their weapon is rendered useless by an acid coating.

Every level in Acidic Spray additionally raises your Mindpower by 4, passively.

At Talent Level 5, this becomes a piercing line of acid.

Each point in acid drake talents also increases your acid resistance by 1%.
}}

{{Ability_box
|game_version = 1.7.4
|name = Across the Veil
|image = across the veil.png
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Necrosis}}
|require = {{TalentReq/SpellsReq2}}
|use_mode = Passive
|desc = 
The line between life and death blurs for you.

You can only die when you reach negative {{ctstd|Con|30|1000}} life but your maximum life is reduced by 0.5 * {{ctstd|Con|30|1000}}.

When you are below 1 life you gain {{cts|6|12%}} to all resistances.

The life amount is based on your Constitution attribute.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Adrenaline_surge_2017.png
|name=Adrenaline Surge
|category_type={{ct|Technique}}
|category={{c|Conditioning}}
|require={{TalentReq/TechsConReq4}}
|cost=0
|cooldown=24
|use_speed=0
|desc=
You release a surge of adrenaline that increases your Physical Power by {{ctstd|Con|5|25}} for {{ctl|24|3|7}} turns. While the effect is active, you may continue to fight beyond the point of exhaustion.

Your stamina based sustains will not be disabled if your stamina reaches zero, and you may continue to use stamina based talents while at zero stamina at the cost of life.
|avail.escorts=[[Escorts#Warrior|Warrior]], via revealing the locked {{c|Conditioning}} category
}}

{{Ability box
|image = Advanced targeting system.png
|name = Advanced Targeting System
|game_version = 1.7.6
|embers_version = 1.1.10
|category_type = {{ct|Steamtech}}
|category = {{c|Armament}}
|require = {{TalentReq/DexSteamReq4}}
|use_mode = Passive
|desc = Enhancements to your targeting systems give all ranged attacks a {{ctl|100|15|40%}} chance to trigger an immediate shot from your tail-mounted steamgun for 100% damage as {{lightning}}.

In addition, your {{physical}} and {{lightning}} resistance penetration is increased by {{ctl|100|17|50%}}.
}}

{{Ability_box
|image=Aegis_2017.png
|name=Aegis
|category_type={{Ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Aegis}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReq4}}
|cost=50 Mana
|cooldown=25
|use_speed=0
|desc=
Release arcane energies into any magical shield currently protecting you, further charging it by (40 + {{ctspd|5|500}} / 10)% of its max absorb value.

It will affect at most {{cts|3|7|log}} shield effects.

Affected shields are: Damage Shield, {{t|Time Shield}}, {{t|Displacement Shield}}, and {{t|Disruption Shield}}.

The charging will increase with your Spellpower.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Aether avatar_2017.png
|name=Aether Avatar
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Aether}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReqHigh3}}
|cost=60 Mana
|cooldown={{ctl|15|37|25}}
|range=10
|use_speed=0
|desc=
Fill yourself with aether forces, completely surrounding your body for {{ctl|15|5|9}} turns.

While active, you can only cast arcane or aether spells, your cooldown for them is divided by 3, your arcane damage is increased by 25%, your {{t|Disruption Shield}} can be used at any time, and your maximum mana is increased by 33%.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Aether beam_2017.png
|name=Aether Beam
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Aether}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReqHigh1}}
|cost=20 Mana
|cooldown=12
|range=6
|desc=
You focus the aether into a spinning beam of arcane energies, doing {{ctspd|20|150}} arcane damage in a radius of 3 squares with a 25% chance to silence any creature it pierces.

The beam will also damage its epicenter each turn for 10% of the damage (but it will not silence).

The beam spins with incredible speed (1600%).

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Aether_breach_2017.png
|name=Aether Breach
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Aether}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReqHigh2}}
|cost=50 Mana
|cooldown=8
|range=7
|desc=
Rupture reality to temporarily open a passage to the aether, triggering {{cts|3.3|4.7}} random arcane explosions in the target area.

Each explosion does {{ctspd|20|180}} arcane damage in radius 2, and will each trigger at one turn intervals.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
}}

{{Ability_box
|image=agile_defense.png
|name=Agile Defense
|game_version=1.5.2
|category_type={{ct|Technique}}
|category={{c|Agility}}
|require={{TalentReq/TechsDexReqHigh1}}
|use_mode=Passive
|desc=
You are trained in an agile, mobile fighting technique combining sling and shield. This allows shields to be equipped, using Dexterity instead of Strength as as requirement.

While you have a shield equip and your Block talent is not on cooldown, you have a {{cTS|15|45%}} chance to deflect any incoming damage, reducing it by 50% of your shield’s block value.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Agile gunner.png
|name=Agile gunner
|game_version=1.7.4
|embers_version=1.1.10
|category_type={{ct|Steamtech}}
|category={{c|Elusiveness}}
|require={{TalentReq/SteamReq2}}
|use_mode=Sustained
|cost=4 Steam drain
|cooldown=15
|use_speed=0
|desc=The thrill of the hunt invigorates you. For each foe in radius {{CTS|2|10}} around you, you gain 20% movement speed (up to {{CTS|60|160%}}).

Current bonus: 0%.

''Note: only visible foes "in sight" will contribute to the movement bonus''
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Agony.png
|name=Agony
|category_type={{ct|Cursed}}
|category={{c|Punishments}}
|require={{TalentReq/CursedCunReq3}}
|range=7
|cost=5 Hate
|cooldown=3
|desc=
Unleash agony upon your target. The pain will grow over the course of 5 turns. The first turn will inflict (0.2 * {{ctmd|0|160}}) damage, and increase linearly to {{ctmd|0|160}} on the last turn, dealing (3 * {{ctmd|0|160}}) total damage.

There is a 25% chance to inflict cross tier effects. The damage will increase with your Mindpower.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Alchemist protection.png
|name=Alchemist Protection
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Explosive Admixtures}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReq2}}
|use_mode=Passive
|desc=
Grants (20 * Raw Talent Level)% protection to you and your golem against the damage of your {{t|Throw Bomb}} and {{t|Shockwave Bomb}}, and against external elemental damage (fire, cold, lightning and acid) by (3 * Raw Talent Level)%.

Other friendly creatures are also protected against your {{t|Throw Bomb}}, but not against {{t|Shockwave Bomb}}.

At talent level 5, the protection will prevent all side effects of your bombs too.
}}

{{Ability box
|game_version=1.7.6
|image=Algid rage.png
|name=Algid Rage
|category_type={{ct|Race}}
|category={{c|Kruk Yeti}}
|require={{TalentReq/RacialReq1}}
|use_speed=instant
|use_mode=Activated
|cooldown={{ctl|5|46|30}}
|desc=Your yeti is attuned to the cold climates.
For 5 turns all damage you deal has {{css|Will|30|50%}} chance to encase the target in an iceblock for 3 turns.
While Algid Rage is up you easily pierce through iceblocks, reducing the damage they absorb by 50%.
The bonus will increase with your Willpower.
}}

{{Ability_box
|image=alloyed_munitions.png
|name=Alloyed Munitions
|game_version=1.5.2
|category_type={{ct|Technique}}
|category={{c|Munitions}}
|require={{TalentReq/TechsDexReqHigh4}}
|use_mode=Passive
|desc=
You mix together your munitions, leading to powerful new effects:

[[Incendiary ammunition (talent)|Incendiary]] - Targets struck by the explosion have their armor and saves reduced by {{cTL|30|5|25|0.75}} for 3 turns, and your physical and fire penetration is increased by {{cTL|35%|10|25%}}.

[[Venomous ammunition (talent)|Venomous]] - Shots deal an additional {{cTWD|10|40%}} weapon damage as nature in a radius 1 (2 at Talent Level 3) ball, which applies numbing poison as per Exotic Munitions. This cannot occur more than once per turn.

[[Piercing ammunition (talent)|Piercing]] - Shots deal {{cTPD|4|36}} physical damage and maim the target, bleeding them for a further {{cTPD|20|180}} physical damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by {{cTL|30%|10|20%}}.

The physical damage dealt, armor penetration and save reduction will increase with your Physical Power.
}}

{{Ability_box
|image=Amplification.png
|name=Amplification
|category_type={{ct|Psionic}}
|category={{c|Feedback}}
|require={{TalentReq/PsiWilReq3}}
|use_mode=Passive
|desc=
Increases your maximum Feedback by (10 * Raw Talent Level), and increases the Feedback you gain from damage by {{cts|15|50%|0.75}}.

The Feedback gain will scale with your Mindpower.
|avail.escorts=[[Escorts#Defiler_.28Arcane.29|Defiler (Arcane)]] ([[Escorts#Betraying_to_Zigur|Betray Escort to Zigur]]), via revealing the locked {{c|Feedback}} category
}}

{{Ability box
|game_version=1.5.10
|image=Anarchic_Walk.png
|name=Anarchic Walk
|category_type={{ct|Demented}}
|category={{c|Beyond Sanity}}
