|use_mode=Active
|cost=-15 insanity
|cooldown=6
|desc=
You consume the chaotic forces of 2 chaos orbs, randomly teleporting you in a general direction up to 8 tiles away.
		You will always travel at least {{CTL|8|1|5}} tiles away if possible.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Anatomy.png
|name=Anatomy
|category_type={{ct|Cursed}}
|category={{c|Predator}}
|require={{TalentReq/CursedLevReq2}}
|use_mode=Passive
|desc=
Your knowledge of your prey allows you to strike with extra precision. Attacks against the marked sub-type gain +{{cts|5|15.4|0.75}} Accuracy, while those against the marked type but different sub-type gain +{{cts|2|9.2|0.75}} Accuracy.

Melee hits gain a chance to stun targets of the marked sub-type for 3 turns with each attack. The chance to stun is {{cl|√ Talent Level|100%|3.1|1|6.93%|2.23}}.

Each point in Anatomy reduces the kill experience required to reach 100% effectivess as a Predator.
}}

[[Category: Removed Talents]]

{{Ability box
|image=Ancestral life.png
