Each time you receive non-regeneration healing you gain min(15, {{ctmd|1|8}})% of a turn per 100 life healed.  This effect can't add energy past 2 stored turns and overhealing is not counted.

Also, regeneration effects on you will decrease your equilibrium by {{cts|0.5|2.5|0.5A}} each turn.

The turn gain increases with your Mindpower.
|avail.classes=[[Oozemancer]], [[Wyrmic]]
|avail.shops=[[Zigur]] ([[Age of Ascendancy]]) — after completing [[Storming the city]], speaking to [[Myssil|Protector Myssil]] and killing [[Urkis]], the {{c|Fungus}} category is revealed (locked)
