|cost=25 Mana
|cooldown=16
|desc=
Imbues your body with arcane forces, reconstructing it to a default state, healing for (40 + {{ctspd|10|520}}) life.

The life healed will increase with your Spellpower.
}}

'''Note:''' Can [[Critical|crit]] - applying more healing according to your critical chance(spell) and critical multiplier.

{{Ability_box
|game_version=1.4.4
|image=Arcane_shield_2017.png
|name=Arcane Shield
|category_type={{Ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Aegis}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReq3}}
|use_mode=Sustained
|cost=50 Mana
|cooldown=30
|desc=
Surround yourself with protective arcane forces.

Each time you receive a direct heal (not a life regeneration effect), you automatically get a damage shield that is proportional to the heal value for 3 turns.

This will replace an existing damage shield if the new shield value and duration would be greater than or equal to the old.

The strength of the damage shield as a percentage of the heal value is {{cl|combat spell damage|100%|20|0|55.4%|354}}.

The shield value will increase with your Spellpower.

'''Note''': Combat spell damage here is defined as: {{ctspd|5|500}}

}}

{{Ability box
|image=Arcane vortex.png
|name=Arcane Vortex
|category_type={{ct|Spell}}
|category={{c|Arcane}}
|require={{TalentReq/SpellsReq3}}
|cost=35 Mana
|cooldown=12
|range=10
|desc=
Creates a vortex of arcane energies on the target for 6 turns. Each turn the vortex will look for another foe in sight and fire a manathrust doing ({{ctspd|20|340}} / 6) arcane damage to all foes in line.

If no foes are found, the target will take 150% more arcane damage.

If the target dies, the vortex explodes, releasing all remaining damage in a radius 2 ball of arcane force.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
}}

{{Ability box
|image=Default.png
|name=Armour Configuration
